            "review_title": "Review at Mr Green",
            "review_text": "Viviannguyen11\nThanh Pho Ho Chi Minh, Dac Lac, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nMr Green-Go fresh everyday-100% FRUIT\nJan 2013 • Friends\nWhen you come to VietNam, the weather is so hot. This is the reason why you should come to Mr Green. Mr green will bring to you the fresh feeling. Moreover, the menu is very multiform, attractive and the name of drink is very special. You can enjoy many kinds of tropical fruits such as: mango, pineapple, passion fruit, banana, dragon, avocado, papaya, lime, guava ,... and the price is cheap about 1 USD. Let's choose a glass of drink and take it go with you. Feel the good taste , come to Mr Green !!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 10, 2013",
